This product is a .NET port of OFD Reader & Writer (ofdrw):

    https://gitee.com/ofdrw/ofdrw      (Gitee mirror, primary reference)
    https://github.com/ofdrw/ofdrw     (original repository)
    Copyright the ofdrw authors
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

The port follows the module and class structure of ofdrw 2.4.0 and translates
the Java sources to C# for .NET 10. Significant modifications include:

  * Java to C# translation of all ported modules;
  * cryptographic, font-metric and imaging operations re-implemented with
    BouncyCastle.Cryptography and SkiaSharp instead of Java providers;
  * additional test fixtures and golden baselines generated against both
    the Java and the .NET implementations.

A detailed list of added, modified and removed functionality is provided in
PORTING-NOTES.md. Bundled third-party components and their licenses are listed
in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md.

